    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Raymond Potterton Auctioneers are delighted to present this distinctive three-bedroom home, one of just four residences created from Athboy's former cut stone engine house.\n\nSet in a small, private development overlooking the park just off the Trim Road, the property combines the character of its original setting with a beautifully renovated interior, all within minutes' walk of Athboy town centre.\n\nFinished to a high standard and ready to move into, the home offers thoughtful fitted features and flexible space for working from home.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a entrance porch, a lounge a guest WC, and a kitchen with newly fitted units and breakfast bar.\n\nOn the first floor are two double bedrooms with new carpets and a renovated bathroom.\n\nThe top floor provides a spacious double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, together with a generous landing featuring a reading nook and room for a home office.\n\nThe property is situated at the former Railway Yard just off the Trim Road, within walking distance of Athboy's shops, schools, community facilities and recreational amenities.\n\nA bus stop across the road provides a regular service to Dublin.\n\nTrim is a short drive away, while Navan and Kells are also readily accessible. \n\nThe M3 motorway is approximately ten minutes away. Rathcairn, with its schools and community centre, is approximately 3 km from Athboy.\n\nAccommodation includes Entrance Hall, Lounge, Kitchen, Guest w.c., 3 Bedrooms, Office and Bathroom.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall - 5'2\" x 4'7\"\nWith wooden flooring.\n\nLounge - 11'1\" x 12'5\"\nWith wooden flooring.\n\nKitchen - 12'9\" x 12'5\"\nWith tiled flooring, built in wall and floor units, breakfast bar, fridge/freezer, oven, hob and extractor fan.\n\nHallway - 5'6\" x 6'6\"\nWith wooden flooring.\n\nGuest w.c. - 4'3\" x 2'7\"\nWith tiled flooring and walls, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nLanding - 5'6\" x 6'6\"\nWith carpet.\n\nBedroom 1 - 11'5\" x 16'8\"\nWith carpet and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 12'9\" x 12'5\"\nWith carpet and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 12'5\" x 11'1\"\nWith carpet and fitted wardrobes.\n\nOffice - 12'5\" x 11'5\"\nWith carpet.\n\nBathroom - 8'2\" x 5'2\"\nWith tiled flooring, partially tiled walls, bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nFEATURES\n\n• Stunning restored cut stone former engine house\n• minutes' walk from Athboy town centre\n• Renovated throughout and ready to move into\n• Fully upgraded in recent years\n• Three double bedrooms\n• Top floor space for a home office\n\nDIRECTIONS\n\nFrom Athboy town centre, proceed along the Trim Road. The former Railway Yard development is located just off this road, overlooking the park.\n\nEIRCODE: C15 T251\n"
      },
